WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:00.500
Ever cleaned

00:00:00.510 --> 00:00:01.350
your entire room

00:00:01.360 --> 00:00:02.850
to avoid one email?

00:00:02.900 --> 00:00:03.630
The email takes

00:00:03.640 --> 00:00:04.550
five minutes.

00:00:04.720 --> 00:00:05.830
Suddenly, your kitchen

00:00:05.840 --> 00:00:06.670
needs forty.
